<p>The Morton County Fair Association was incorporated in July 1895 with George Harmon as president, A. E. Thorberg, vice-president and C. L. Timmerman as secretary. Articles of incorporation were prepared by T. C. Kennelly, W. S. Barrows and Elijah Boley. Tipis at 1895 Mandan State Fair</p>

