<p>Prizes were typically donated by local businesses. The Fair was successful both financially and in terms of regional participation. Receipts totaled $4181 and covered its expenses. The Fair features roping and horse racing events.The 1904 North Dakota State Fair and was the last which permitted the roping of big range steers. Click to Enlarge 1906 Indian Horse Race</p>

